+issueNumber: MDL-88319
+notes:
+  core:
+    - message: >-
+        A new hook, `\core\hook\output\before_help_icon_rendered`, is now dispatched by
+        `core_renderer::render_help_icon()` before the help icon template is rendered. Plugins can use it to
+        modify the popover content (via the mutable template context returned by `get_context()`), add HTML
+        before or after the icon (`add_before_icon()` / `add_after_icon()`), or fully replace the icon output
+        (`set_replacement()`).
+      type: improved
